  "There's dark, cloudy sky above you.",
  "You are in the front yard of the Linder property. Most of the space is occupied by a kitchen garden full of vegetables and herbs. A wooden fence surrounds the yard on the west and north sides. To the east is the house, with a French door and two windows. To the south is a gate that leads to the front porch.",
